abstract: >-
  Sequences, molecular formulas, average and monoisotopic masses, CAS registry
  numbers, PubChem and UNII identifiers for 107 research peptides, proteins,
  metal complexes and small molecules, with 90 catalogue products linked to
  their source pages.
keywords:
  - peptides
  - chemistry
  - molecular weight
  - CAS registry number
  - dataset
